---
import { legacyIds } from '../../data/legacy-ids.mjs';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" style="background:#0A0A0A;">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0A0A">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>正在打开文章 — 个人商业创造者</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
<style>
  body{font-family:'Noto Sans SC','Inter',sans-serif;background:#0A0A0A;color:#A1A1AA;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;line-height:1.8;text-align:center;}
  a{color:#39FF14;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(57,255,20,.35);}
  p{font-size:14px;}
</style>
<script is:inline define:vars={{ legacyIds }}>
  const raw = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('id');
  const slug = raw ? legacyIds[Number(raw)] : null;
  location.replace(slug ? `/insight/${slug}/` : '/insights/');
</script>
</head>
<body>
  <p>正在打开文章… 如果没有自动跳转，<a href="/insights">回到洞察列表</a>。</p>
</body>
</html>
